{"assets":["/statement-assets/bd1d7eaa4a8979d62a9e782bdf9e2249ed9c2521ed4cb890d21e1ee142301dc1.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"2008","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B. Square or Not"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A beautiful binary matrix is a matrix that has ones on its edges and zeros inside."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/bd1d7eaa4a8979d62a9e782bdf9e2249ed9c2521ed4cb890d21e1ee142301dc1.png"},"kind":"image"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples of four beautiful binary matrices."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Today, Sakurako was playing with a beautiful binary matrix of size $$$r \\times c$$$ and created a binary string $$$s$$$ by writing down all the rows of the matrix, starting from the first and ending with the $$$r$$$-th. More formally, the element from the matrix in the $$$i$$$-th row and $$$j$$$-th column corresponds to the $$$((i-1)*c+j)$$$-th element of the string."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You need to check whether the beautiful matrix from which the string $$$s$$$ was obtained could be "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"squared"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". In other words, you need to check whether the string $$$s$$$ could have been build from a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"square"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" beautiful binary matrix (i.e., one where $$$r=c$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains a single integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 10^4$$$) — the number of test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains a single integer $$$n$$$ ($$$2 \\le n \\le 2 \\cdot 10^5$$$) — the length of the string."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line of each test case contains the string $$$s$$$ of length $$$n$$$. "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The string is always the result of writing out the strings of a beautiful matrix."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the sum of $$$n$$$ across all test cases does not exceed $$$2 \\cdot 10^5$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Yes"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", if the original matrix could have been square, and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"No"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" otherwise."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5\n2\n11\n4\n1111\n9\n111101111\n9\n111111111\n12\n111110011111\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nNo\nYes\nYes\nNo\nNo\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For the second test case, string 1111 can be obtained from the matrix:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$1$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$1$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$1$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$1$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"}],"kind":"table_body"}],"kind":"table"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For the third test case, string 111101111 can be obtained from the matrix:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$1$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$1$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$1$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$1$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$0$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$1$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$1$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$1$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$1$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"}],"kind":"table_body"}],"kind":"table"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"There is no square matrix in the fourth case, such that the string can be obtained from it."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"B","problemCode":"2008B","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/2008/problem/B"}